  <explanation>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>Set up allocation of revenue and COGS by lines of business</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>تنظیم تسهیم درآمد و بهای تمام‌شده کالای فروش‌رفته بر اساس خطوط کسب‌وکار</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Impostare la distribuzione dei ricavi e il costo del venduto per settori di attività</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Ustawienie podziału utargu i kosztów własnych sprzedaży według kierunków działalności</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Настройка распределения выручки и себестоимости продаж по направлениям деятельности</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>İş kollarına göre gelir ve satış maliyeti dağıtımı ayarı</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Tùy chỉnh phân bổ doanh thu và giá vốn hàng bán theo mảng hoạt động</value>
  </explanation>
  <resources uuid="6cdc5268-91c4-47a1-917c-ec51d3a3d144">
    <name>LineOfBusinessAllocationMethod</name>
    <synonym>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Line of business / Allocation method</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>خط کسب‌وکار / روش تسهیم</value>
    </synonym>
